ns","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Uzeil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Uzeil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Uzeil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Uzeil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-10T13:51:43Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T13:51:43Z","body":"Gotcha, I'll update the description to reflect that","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4670960903/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4671062570","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120143#issuecomment-4671062570","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120143","id":4671062570,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFmrCKg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-10T14:02:11Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T14:03:48Z","body":"I suspect this is more strictly on the editor side when I look closer.\n\nThe detach operation is handled here:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ec67cbe92628bdaf979b10594359ba6f02cf8838/editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp#L848-L864\n\nWhich will set the script to the parent script, this in turn is handled here:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ec67cbe92628bdaf979b10594359ba6f02cf8838/core/object/object.cpp#L978-L994\n\nWhich removes the script instance, which should erase the custom data entirely when assigning\n\nI think the solution here, at least on the editor side, is to track all the properties from the parent script and making sure to assign them after the swap\n\nIt might be possible to handle it core side but I'm not sure switching the script fundamentally is safe, but it might be an issue with that\n\nSo in summary, one of two things need to be done here:\n* Either make sure the editor tracks properties from the parent script, or\n* Make sure that assigning the script for an object to a parent script of the current script preserves properties","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4671062570/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]